---Database, Server or Elastic Pool Recommended Action.
---@class azure.sql.RecommendedAction
---@field id? string Fully qualified resource ID for the resource. E.g. "/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/{resourceProviderNamespace}/{resourceType}/{resourceName}"
---@field name? string The name of the resource
---@field type? string The type of the resource. E.g. "Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines" or "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts"
---@field systemData? azure.sql.SystemData Azure Resource Manager metadata containing createdBy and modifiedBy information.
---@field properties? azure.sql.RecommendedActionProperties Resource properties.
---@field kind? string Resource kind.
---@field location? string Resource location.

---Current state the recommended action is in. Some commonly used states are: Active      -> recommended action is active and no action has been taken yet. Pending     -> recommended action is approved for and is awaiting execution. Executing   -> recommended action is being applied on the user database. Verifying   -> recommended action was applied and is being verified of its usefulness by the system. Success     -> recommended action was applied and improvement found during verification. Pending Revert  -> verification found little or no improvement so recommended action is queued for revert or user has manually reverted. Reverting   -> changes made while applying recommended action are being reverted on the user database. Reverted    -> successfully reverted the changes made by recommended action on user database. Ignored     -> user explicitly ignored/discarded the recommended action.
---@alias azure.sql.RecommendedActionCurrentState "Active"|"Pending"|"Executing"|"Verifying"|"PendingRevert"|"RevertCancelled"|"Reverting"|"Reverted"|"Ignored"|"Expired"|"Monitoring"|"Resolved"|"Success"|"Error"

---Contains error information for an Azure SQL Database, Server or Elastic Pool Recommended Action.
---@class azure.sql.RecommendedActionErrorInfo
---@field errorCode? string Gets the reason why the recommended action was put to error state. e.g., DatabaseHasQdsOff, IndexAlreadyExists
---@field isRetryable? azure.sql.IsRetryable Gets whether the error could be ignored and recommended action could be retried. Possible values are: Yes/No

---Contains information of estimated or observed impact on various metrics for an Azure SQL Database, Server or Elastic Pool Recommended Action.
---@class azure.sql.RecommendedActionImpactRecord
---@field dimensionName? string Gets the name of the impact dimension. e.g., CPUChange, DiskSpaceChange, NumberOfQueriesAffected.
---@field unit? string Gets the name of the impact dimension. e.g., CPUChange, DiskSpaceChange, NumberOfQueriesAffected.
---@field absoluteValue? number Gets the absolute value of this dimension if applicable. e.g., Number of Queries affected
---@field changeValueAbsolute? number Gets the absolute change in the value of this dimension. e.g., Absolute Disk space change in Megabytes
---@field changeValueRelative? number Gets the relative change in the value of this dimension. e.g., Relative Disk space change in Percentage

---Contains information for manual implementation for an Azure SQL Database, Server or Elastic Pool Recommended Action.
---@class azure.sql.RecommendedActionImplementationInfo
---@field method? azure.sql.ImplementationMethod Gets the method in which this recommended action can be manually implemented. e.g., TSql, AzurePowerShell.
---@field script? string Gets the manual implementation script. e.g., T-SQL script that could be executed on the database.

---Gets if approval for applying this recommended action was given by user/system.
---@alias azure.sql.RecommendedActionInitiatedBy "User"|"System"

---Contains time series of various impacted metrics for an Azure SQL Database, Server or Elastic Pool Recommended Action.
---@class azure.sql.RecommendedActionMetricInfo
---@field metricName? string Gets the name of the metric. e.g., CPU, Number of Queries.
---@field unit? string Gets the unit in which metric is measured. e.g., DTU, Frequency
---@field timeGrain? string Gets the duration of time interval for the value given by this MetricInfo. e.g., PT1H (1 hour)
---@field startTime? string Gets the start time of time interval given by this MetricInfo.
---@field value? number Gets the value of the metric in the time interval given by this MetricInfo.

---Properties for a Database, Server or Elastic Pool Recommended Action.
---@class azure.sql.RecommendedActionProperties
---@field recommendationReason? string Gets the reason for recommending this action. e.g., DuplicateIndex
---@field validSince? string Gets the time since when this recommended action is valid.
---@field lastRefresh? string Gets time when this recommended action was last refreshed.
---@field state azure.sql.RecommendedActionStateInfo Gets the info of the current state the recommended action is in.
---@field isExecutableAction? boolean Gets if this recommended action is actionable by user
---@field isRevertableAction? boolean Gets if changes applied by this recommended action can be reverted by user
---@field isArchivedAction? boolean Gets if this recommended action was suggested some time ago but user chose to ignore this and system added a new recommended action again.
---@field executeActionStartTime? string Gets the time when system started applying this recommended action on the user resource. e.g., index creation start time
---@field executeActionDuration? string Gets the time taken for applying this recommended action on user resource. e.g., time taken for index creation
---@field revertActionStartTime? string Gets the time when system started reverting changes of this recommended action on user resource. e.g., time when index drop is executed.
---@field revertActionDuration? string Gets the time taken for reverting changes of this recommended action on user resource. e.g., time taken for dropping the created index.
---@field executeActionInitiatedBy? azure.sql.RecommendedActionInitiatedBy Gets if approval for applying this recommended action was given by user/system.
---@field executeActionInitiatedTime? string Gets the time when this recommended action was approved for execution.
---@field revertActionInitiatedBy? azure.sql.RecommendedActionInitiatedBy Gets if approval for reverting this recommended action was given by user/system.
---@field revertActionInitiatedTime? string Gets the time when this recommended action was approved for revert.
---@field score? number Gets the impact of this recommended action. Possible values are 1 - Low impact, 2 - Medium Impact and 3 - High Impact
---@field implementationDetails? azure.sql.RecommendedActionImplementationInfo Gets the implementation details of this recommended action for user to apply it manually.
---@field errorDetails? azure.sql.RecommendedActionErrorInfo Gets the error details if and why this recommended action is put to error state.
---@field estimatedImpact? azure.sql.RecommendedActionPropertiesEstimatedImpactList Gets the estimated impact info for this recommended action e.g., Estimated CPU gain, Estimated Disk Space change
---@field observedImpact? azure.sql.RecommendedActionPropertiesObservedImpactList Gets the observed/actual impact info for this recommended action e.g., Actual CPU gain, Actual Disk Space change
---@field timeSeries? azure.sql.RecommendedActionPropertiesTimeSeriesList Gets the time series info of metrics for this recommended action e.g., CPU consumption time series
---@field linkedObjects? azure.sql.RecommendedActionPropertiesLinkedObjectsList Gets the linked objects, if any.
---@field details? azure.sql.RecommendedActionPropertiesDetailsMap Gets additional details specific to this recommended action.

---Gets additional details specific to this recommended action.
---@alias azure.sql.RecommendedActionPropertiesDetailsMap { [string]: string }

---Gets the estimated impact info for this recommended action e.g., Estimated CPU gain, Estimated Disk Space change
---@alias azure.sql.RecommendedActionPropertiesEstimatedImpactList azure.sql.RecommendedActionImpactRecord[]

